@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@relayAccessToken = {{$dotenv RELAY_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@recipientDeviceId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@messageId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Queue an opaque encrypted message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relay/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{relayAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "{{messageId}}",
  "recipientDeviceId": "{{recipientDeviceId}}",
  "expiresAtUtc": "2026-10-12T12:00:00Z",
  "ciphertext": "AQIDBA=="
}

### Read messages addressed to the authenticated device
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relay/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{relayAccessToken}}

### Read one addressed message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relay/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{relayAccessToken}}

### Acknowledge and delete a delivered message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relay/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{relayAccessToken}}

### Revoke a device (token must include family_role=admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relay/devices/{{recipientDeviceId}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{relayAccessToken}}